---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service | Scott's Electric (Hampton Roads 757)"
  description="Terms of Service for Scott's Electric electrical estimates, service dispatch, municipal permits, and Master Electrician work across 757."
>
  <section class="py-16 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-card to-brand-dark border-b border-brand-border">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-brand-gold mt-2">Last Updated: July 2026 • Scott's Electric (Hampton Roads, VA)</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-brand-dark">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-300">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing the Scott's Electric website (<a href="https://scottselectric.pro" class="text-brand-gold underline">scottselectric.pro</a>) or requesting electrical services, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Service.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">2. Electrical Estimates & Calculations</h2>
        <p>
          Online quote calculators and preliminary budget estimates provided on this site are for planning purposes. Final contract pricing is confirmed after an on-site electrical inspection and load calculation performed by our certified Master Electrician.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">3. Permitting & Code Compliance</h2>
        <p>
          All electrical repairs, panel replacements, EV charger installations, and generator setups are executed in strict accordance with the Virginia Uniform Statewide Building Code (USBC) and National Electrical Code (NEC). Scott's Electric handles municipal permit filings across Virginia Beach, Norfolk, Chesapeake, Newport News, Hampton, Portsmouth, and Suffolk.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">4. Emergency Dispatch & Service Calls</h2>
        <p>
          24/7 Emergency dispatch services are subject to technician availability and extreme weather conditions. For immediate emergency response, call <a href="tel:7575360478" class="text-brand-gold underline">(757) 536-0478</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">5. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          For questions regarding these Terms of Service, contact Scott's Electric at <a href="mailto:info@scottselectric.pro" class="text-brand-gold underline">info@scottselectric.pro</a> or <a href="tel:7575360478" class="text-brand-gold underline">(757) 536-0478</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
